<title>HONG KONG: Swire Pac names Bell as finance director.</title>
<headline>Swire Pac names Bell as finance director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd has appointed Michael Bell as finance director with effect from April 7, the Swire Group said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The appointment follows the resignation of Simon Heale, it said.</p>
<p>Bell, who has been with the Swire Group for 25 years, is currently finance director of China Navigation Co, the Swire Group's private shipping arm, and Swire Pacific Offshore.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
